Package: autosync-desktop
Version: __VERSION__
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Maintainer: AutoSync Internal <noreply@autosync.local>
Depends: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0
Description: AutoSync — internal auto-service platform (desktop app, no Docker)
 Single self-contained binary bundling backend, frontend and the LLM
 wrapper service — SQLite instead of PostgreSQL, in-process task queue
 instead of Celery/Redis. Installs and runs like a regular desktop
 application: launch from the applications menu, opens in its own window
 (system webview, no Chromium bundled) — closing it exits the app.
 Also reachable from other devices on the same network at this machine's
 address while the window is open.
 .
 First launch walks you through creating an administrator account
 directly in the app window — no command line needed.
 .
 Requires a local Ollama installation (https://ollama.com) for
 LLM-powered features (price suggestions, catalog matching fallback,
 SEO card generation); everything else works without it.
